This query confirms that even though the ROI is good, the `n_interest` is 7, which means I should not report the interest figure confidently. The query as written above has `HAVING n >= 8` at the end which means the whole row would be filtered out if `n` was less than 8. But in this case, `n` is 9, so the row is returned, but `n_interest` is 7. My conclusion above is accurate.

